{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Whats in this demo?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy 24 hand crafted puzzles to try and a look at all the features available in the full game.\u00a0<strong></strong><br>Sequel to #1 puzzle game, KAMI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041040/extras/5d9049c52cf9a5e1b0918a9ce2ba5969.poster.avif?t=1760370852\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041040/extras/5d9049c52cf9a5e1b0918a9ce2ba5969.webm?t=1760370852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041040/extras/5d9049c52cf9a5e1b0918a9ce2ba5969.mp4?t=1760370852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The calming yet addictive puzzle game is back!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 100 hand-crafted puzzles, Kami 2 takes you on a mind-twisting journey that combines logic and problem-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041040/extras/c999550e46204b6b1737b5c9056dbed0.poster.avif?t=1760370852\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041040/extras/c999550e46204b6b1737b5c9056dbed0.webm?t=1760370852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041040/extras/c999550e46204b6b1737b5c9056dbed0.mp4?t=1760370852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you achieve perfection?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flood each puzzle with a single color in as few moves as possible to claim a 'Perfect' sticker. But watch out for subtle new tricks and fiendish surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041040/extras/f447ca7f7abbe7735599981621b4a263.poster.avif?t=1760370852\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041040/extras/f447ca7f7abbe7735599981621b4a263.webm?t=1760370852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041040/extras/f447ca7f7abbe7735599981621b4a263.mp4?t=1760370852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Want even more?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the global Daily Challenge, earn a winning streak and compare your scores to other players. Test yourself on thousands of user-generated puzzles, uploaded daily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041040/extras/7357c7cfcc817db12f092f78480636c7.poster.avif?t=1760370852\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041040/extras/7357c7cfcc817db12f092f78480636c7.webm?t=1760370852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041040/extras/7357c7cfcc817db12f092f78480636c7.mp4?t=1760370852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get creative and take on the world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own KAMI designs using the Puzzle Builder. Design and share your creations, send them to your friends and challenge the world to beat your score.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4041040?t=1760370852","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4041040?t=1760370852","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041040/f368e2b8c2a9777a9a67b41c83d62e9165ce7251/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760370852","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041040/f368e2b8c2a9777a9a67b41c83d62e9165ce7251/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760370852","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Whats in this demo?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy 24 hand crafted puzzles to try and a look at all the features available in the full game.\u00a0<strong></strong><br>Sequel to #1 puzzle game, KAMI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041040/extras/5d9049c52cf9a5e1b0918a9ce2ba5969.poster.avif?t=1760370852\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041040/extras/5d9049c52cf9a5e1b0918a9ce2ba5969.webm?t=1760370852\" type=\"vide