om/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041040/extras/f447ca7f7abbe7735599981621b4a263.mp4?t=1760370852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Want even more?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the global Daily Challenge, earn a winning streak and compare your scores to other players. Test yourself on thousands of user-generated puzzles, uploaded daily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041040/extras/7357c7cfcc817db12f092f78480636c7.poster.avif?t=1760370852\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041040/extras/7357c7cfcc817db12f092f78480636c7.webm?t=1760370852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041040/extras/7357c7cfcc817db12f092f78480636c7.mp4?t=1760370852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get creative and take on the world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own KAMI designs using the Puzzle Builder. Design and share your creations, send them to your friends and challenge the world to beat your score.</p>","developers":["State of Play","Hairy Heart"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3414340","name":"KAMI 2"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041040/a5547e372d2f9e807d4d0a266765639f9a817330/header.jpg?t=1760370852","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"State of Play","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Kernel 6.11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2Ghz x86<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RA